When naming game concepts or deciding current behavior, use `CONTEXT.md` first.

It supersedes older `GAME_PLAN.md` / `ARCHITECTURE.md` lines about: no hub, mission Save & Exit, correction-after-reward, Grade 6, supply caches, and installed spoken-help packs.

The shipped loop is camp portal → combat → five answers → correction (if needed) → reward → loot → shop. Leaving camp drops the mission; profiles and history persist.

Keep balance numbers in `content/balance/` labeled as prototype tuning unless the owner chose a specific value.
